idence for the second valuation of CLM-33702."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-06", "persona_id": "W2", "use_case": "I-12", "title_en": "Car advert 3 — 2021 Camry SAR 49,000", "title_ar": "إعلان سيارة 3 — كامري 2021 بسعر 49,000 ريال", "storage_path": "demo-assets/docs/W2-car-adverts-3.png", "content_type": "image/png", "description_en": "Market advert screenshot used as evidence for the second valuation of CLM-33702."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-07", "persona_id": "W3", "use_case": "I-24", "title_en": "Airline Property Irregularity Report (Madrid)", "title_ar": "تقرير الأمتعة المفقودة من شركة الطيران (مدريد)", "storage_path": "demo-assets/docs/W3-baggage-report.pdf", "content_type": "application/pdf", "description_en": "PIR issued at Madrid-Barajas for Abdulaziz Al-Dosari's missing bag — send to open a travel claim."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-08", "persona_id": "W3", "use_case": "I-24", "title_en": "Boarding pass RUH → MAD", "title_ar": "بطاقة صعود الطائرة الرياض ← مدريد", "storage_path": "demo-assets/docs/W3-boarding-pass.pdf", "content_type": "application/pdf", "description_en": "Boarding pass for the same flight — send together with the PIR."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-09", "persona_id": "W1", "use_case": "I-25", "title_en": "Burst pipe — photo 1 (pipe)", "title_ar": "انفجار ماسورة — صورة 1 (الماسورة)", "storage_path": "demo-assets/photos/W1-burst-pipe-1.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "description_en": "Render of the burst pipe under the kitchen sink."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-10", "persona_id": "W1", "use_case": "I-25", "title_en": "Burst pipe — photo 2 (floor)", "title_ar": "انفجار ماسورة — صورة 2 (الأرضية)", "storage_path": "demo-assets/photos/W1-burst-pipe-2.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "description_en": "Render of the water-damaged floor."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-11", "persona_id": "W1", "use_case": "I-25", "title_en": "Burst pipe — photo 3 (furniture)", "title_ar": "انفجار ماسورة — صورة 3 (الأثاث)", "storage_path": "demo-assets/photos/W1-burst-pipe-3.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "description_en": "Render of the water-damaged sofa and rug."}, {"asset_id": "WTQ-AST-12", "persona_id": "TP", "use_case": "I-13", "title_en": "Najm report summary NJM-2610587", "title_ar": "ملخص تقرير نجم NJM-2610587", "storage_path": "demo-assets/docs/I13-najm-report-summary.pdf", "content_type": "application/pdf", "description_en": "Third-party demo: Majed Al-Otaibi's copy of the Najm report (Watheeq customer 100% at fault). Any phone can use it."}]$seed$::jsonb)
